 reached`) and latency spikes to ~5 seconds (matching its `DB_POOL_TIMEOUT_S` configuration).\\n- **02:52:48 UTC**: `api-gateway` starts returning 503 errors to clients on `/v1/checkout` due to upstream timeout", "output_ref": null, "score": null, "total_tokens": 22443, "cost_usd": 0.0, "wall_ms": 290, "would_be_cost_usd": 0.00858}
